                        <td colspan="10">BCNE/42728 SBZ arrived at 19:11 then xing with 19623. At 19:26 starter given for BCNE but LP informed that Axle locked of 2nd trolly of loco(04 Axle) and train is unable to move then starter put back at 19:32 hrs. Loco NO-42728/SYH WAG-9. IA-16/05/26, IB- 14/08/26. Technician arrival 00:35 hrs, 09/08/26, Loco detached from load 04:20hrs. Handed over to Technician-04:45 hrs.</td>
